    "Configure Model Context Protocol server parameters and execution transport.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0627\u0636\u0628\u0637 \u0645\u0639\u0644\u0645\u0627\u062a \u062e\u0627\u062f\u0645 Model Context Protocol \u0648\u0648\u0633\u064a\u0644\u0629 \u0646\u0642\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0646\u0641\u064a\u0630."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konfigurieren Sie die Parameter des Model-Context-Protocol-Servers und den Ausf\u00fchrungstransport."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure Model Context Protocol server parameters and execution transport."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configura los par\u00e1metros del servidor Model Context Protocol y el transporte de ejecuci\u00f3n."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configurez les param\u00e8tres du serveur Model Context Protocol et le transport d'ex\u00e9cution."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05d4\u05d2\u05d3\u05e8 \u05d0\u05ea \u05e4\u05e8\u05de\u05d8\u05e8\u05d9 \u05e9\u05e8\u05ea Model Context Protocol \u05d5\u05d0\u05ea \u05d0\u05de\u05e6\u05e2\u05d9 \u05d4\u05d4\u05e2\u05d1\u05e8\u05d4 \u05dc\u05d1\u05d9\u05e6\u05d5\u05e2."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Model Context Protocol \u0938\u0930\u094d\u0935\u0930 \u092a\u0948\u0930\u093e\u092e\u0940\u091f\u0930 \u0914\u0930 \u0928\u093f\u0937\u094d\u092a\u093e\u0926\u0928 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u093e\u0902\u0938\u092a\u094b\u0930\u094d\u091f \u0915\u0949\u0928\u094d\u092b\u093c\u093f\u0917\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konfigurasikan parameter server Model Context Protocol dan transport eksekusi."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configura i parametri del server Model Context Protocol e il trasporto di esecuzione."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Model Context Protocol \u30b5\u30fc\u30d0\u30fc\u306e\u30d1\u30e9\u30e1\u30fc\u30bf\u3068\u5b9f\u884c\u30c8\u30e9\u30f3\u30b9\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u3092\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Model Context Protocol \uc11c\ubc84 \ub9e4\uac1c\ubcc0\uc218\uc640 \uc2e4\ud589 \uc804\uc1a1 \ubc29\uc2dd\uc744 \uad6c\uc131\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configureer de parameters van de Model Context Protocol-server en het uitvoeringstransport."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skonfiguruj parametry serwera Model Context Protocol i transport wykonywania."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure os par\u00e2metros do servidor Model Context Protocol e o transporte de execu\u00e7\u00e3o."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043f\u0430\u0440\u0430\u043c\u0435\u0442\u0440\u044b \u0441\u0435\u0440\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0430 Model Context Protocol \u0438 \u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0441\u043f\u043e\u0440\u0442 \u0432\u044b\u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konfigurera parametrar f\u00f6r Model Context Protocol-servern och exekveringstransporten."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Model Context Protocol sunucu parametrelerini ve y\u00fcr\u00fctme aktar\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131n."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041d\u0430\u043b\u0430\u0448\u0442\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043f\u0430\u0440\u0430\u043c\u0435\u0442\u0440\u0438 \u0441\u0435\u0440\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0430 Model Context Protocol \u0456 \u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0441\u043f\u043e\u0440\u0442 \u0432\u0438\u043a\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh tham s\u1ed1 m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7 Model Context Protocol v\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i th\u1ef1c thi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u914d\u7f6e Model Context Protocol \u670d\u52a1\u5668\u53c2\u6570\u548c\u6267\u884c\u4f20\u8f93\u65b9\u5f0f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8a2d\u5b9a Model Context Protocol \u4f3a\u670d\u5668\u53c3\u6578\u8207\u57f7\u884c\u50b3\u8f38\u65b9\u5f0f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Configure deterministic actions, guardrails, and lifecycle event handlers.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0627\u0636\u0628\u0637 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u062c\u0631\u0627\u0621\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062d\u062a\u0645\u064a\u0629 \u0648\u062d\u0648\u0627\u062c\u0632 \u0627\u0644\u062d\u0645\u0627\u064a\u0629 \u0648\u0645\u0639\u0627\u0644\u062c\u0627\u062a \u0623\u062d\u062f\u0627\u062b \u062f\u0648\u0631\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062d\u064a\u0627\u0629."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konfigurieren Sie deterministische Aktionen, Schutzmechanismen und Handler f\u00fcr Lebenszyklusereignisse."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure deterministic actions, guardrails, and lifecycle event handlers."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configura acciones deterministas, salvaguardas y gestores de eventos del ciclo de vida."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configurez des actions d\u00e9terministes, des garde-fous et des gestionnaires d'\u00e9v\u00e9nements de cycle de vie."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05d4\u05d2\u05d3\u05e8 \u05e4\u05e2\u05d5\u05dc\u05d5\u05ea \u05d3\u05d8\u05e8\u05de\u05d9\u05e0\u05d9\u05e1\u05d8\u05d9\u05d5\u05ea, \u05de\u05e2\u05e7\u05d5\u05ea \u05d1\u05d8\u05d9\u05d7\u05d5\u05ea \u05d5\u05de\u05d8\u05e4\u05dc\u05d9 \u05d0\u05d9\u05e8\u05d5\u05e2\u05d9 \u05de\u05d7\u05d6\u05d5\u05e8 \u05d7\u05d9\u05d9\u05dd."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0928\u093f\u092f\u0924\u093e\u0924\u094d\u092e\u0915 \u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e\u090f\u0902, \u0917\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0921\u0930\u0947\u0932 \u0914\u0930 \u0932\u093e\u0907\u092b\u093c\u0938\u093e\u0907\u0915\u0932 \u0907\u0935\u0947\u0902\u091f \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0921\u0932\u0930 \u0915\u0949\u0928\u094d\u092b\u093c\u093f\u0917\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konfigurasikan tindakan deterministik, pagar pengaman, dan penangan peristiwa siklus hidup."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configura azioni deterministiche, protezioni e gestori di eventi del ciclo di vita."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6c7a\u5b9a\u7684\u306a\u30a2\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3001\u30ac\u30fc\u30c9\u30ec\u30fc\u30eb\u3001\u30e9\u30a4\u30d5\u30b5\u30a4\u30af\u30eb\u30a4\u30d9\u30f3\u30c8\u30cf\u30f3\u30c9\u30e9\u3092\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uacb0\uc815\uc801 \ub3d9\uc791, \uac00\ub4dc\ub808\uc77c, \uc218\uba85 \uc8fc\uae30 \uc774\ubca4\ud2b8 \ud578\ub4e4\ub7ec\ub97c \uad6c\uc131\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configureer deterministische acties, vangrails en handlers voor levenscyclusgebeurtenissen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skonfiguruj deterministyczne akcje, zabezpieczenia i obs\u0142ug\u0119 zdarze\u0144 cyklu \u017cycia."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure a\u00e7\u00f5es determin\u00edsticas, prote\u00e7\u00f5es e manipuladores de eventos de ciclo de vida."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u0442\u0435\u0440\u043c\u0438\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0438\u044f, \u043e\u0433\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u0438 \u0438 \u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0447\u0438\u043a\u0438 \u0441\u043e\u0431\u044b\u0442\u0438\u0439 \u0436\u0438\u0437\u043d\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0446\u0438\u043a\u043b\u0430."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konfigurera deterministiska \u00e5tg\u00e4rder, skyddsr\u00e4cken och hanterare f\u00f6r livscykelh\u00e4ndelser."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belirlenimci eylemleri, koruma kurallar\u0131n\u0131 ve ya\u015fam d\u00f6ng\u00fcs\u00fc olay i\u015fleyicilerini yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131n."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041d\u0430\u043b\u0430\u0448\u0442\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u0442\u0435\u0440\u043c\u0456\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0456 \u0434\u0456\u0457, \u0437\u0430\u043f\u043e\u0431\u0456\u0436\u043d\u0438\u043a\u0438 \u0442\u0430 \u043e\u0431\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043d\u0438\u043a\u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0456\u0439 \u0436\u0438\u0442\u0442\u0454\u0432\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0446\u0438\u043a\u043b\u0443."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh c\u00e1c h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ecbnh, r\u00e0o ch\u1eafn an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 tr\u00ecnh x\u1eed l\u00fd s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00f2ng \u0111\u1eddi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u914d\u7f6e\u786e\u5b9a\u6027\u64cd\u4f5c\u3001\u9632\u62a4\u89c4\u5219\u548c\u751f\u547d\u5468\u671f\u4e8b\u4ef6\u5904\u7406\u7a0b\u5e8f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8a2d\u5b9a\u78ba\u5b9a\u6027\u52d5\u4f5c\u3001\u9632\u8b77\u898f\u5247\u8207\u751f\u547d\u9031\u671f\u4e8b\u4ef6\u8655\u7406\u5e38\u5f0f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
