    "Enter a GitHub repository (e.g. 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') or direct HTTPS URL to browse and install remote skills.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0623\u062f\u062e\u0644 \u0645\u0633\u062a\u0648\u062f\u0639 GitHub (\u0645\u062b\u0644 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') \u0623\u0648 \u0639\u0646\u0648\u0627\u0646 HTTPS \u0645\u0628\u0627\u0634\u0631\u0627 \u0644\u062a\u0635\u0641\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0647\u0627\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0639\u064a\u062f\u0629 \u0648\u062a\u062b\u0628\u064a\u062a\u0647\u0627."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geben Sie ein GitHub-Repository (z. B. 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') oder eine direkte HTTPS-URL ein, um Remote-Skills zu durchsuchen und zu installieren."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter a GitHub repository (e.g. 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') or direct HTTPS URL to browse and install remote skills."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Introduce un repositorio de GitHub (p. ej. 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') o una URL HTTPS directa para explorar e instalar habilidades remotas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saisissez un d\u00e9p\u00f4t GitHub (par ex. 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') ou une URL HTTPS directe pour parcourir et installer des comp\u00e9tences distantes."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05d4\u05d6\u05df \u05de\u05d0\u05d2\u05e8 GitHub (\u05dc\u05de\u05e9\u05dc 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') \u05d0\u05d5 \u05db\u05ea\u05d5\u05d1\u05ea HTTPS \u05d9\u05e9\u05d9\u05e8\u05d4 \u05db\u05d3\u05d9 \u05dc\u05e2\u05d9\u05d9\u05df \u05d1\u05de\u05d9\u05d5\u05de\u05e0\u05d5\u05d9\u05d5\u05ea \u05de\u05e8\u05d5\u05d7\u05e7\u05d5\u05ea \u05d5\u05dc\u05d4\u05ea\u05e7\u05d9\u05df \u05d0\u05d5\u05ea\u05df."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0930\u093f\u092e\u094b\u091f \u0938\u094d\u0915\u093f\u0932 \u092c\u094d\u0930\u093e\u0909\u091c\u093c \u0914\u0930 \u0907\u0902\u0938\u094d\u091f\u0949\u0932 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f GitHub \u0930\u093f\u092a\u0949\u091c\u093f\u091f\u0930\u0940 (\u091c\u0948\u0938\u0947 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') \u092f\u093e \u0938\u0940\u0927\u093e HTTPS URL \u0926\u0930\u094d\u091c \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masukkan repositori GitHub (mis. 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') atau URL HTTPS langsung untuk menjelajahi dan memasang keterampilan jarak jauh."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inserisci un repository GitHub (ad es. 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') o un URL HTTPS diretto per esplorare e installare competenze remote."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30ea\u30e2\u30fc\u30c8\u30b9\u30ad\u30eb\u3092\u95b2\u89a7\u3057\u3066\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\u3059\u308b\u306b\u306f\u3001GitHub \u30ea\u30dd\u30b8\u30c8\u30ea (\u4f8b: 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') \u307e\u305f\u306f HTTPS URL \u3092\u76f4\u63a5\u5165\u529b\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc6d0\uaca9 \uc2a4\ud0ac\uc744 \uc0b4\ud3b4\ubcf4\uace0 \uc124\uce58\ud558\ub824\uba74 GitHub \ub9ac\ud3ec\uc9c0\ud1a0\ub9ac(\uc608: 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') \ub610\ub294 \uc9c1\uc811 HTTPS URL\uc744 \uc785\ub825\ud558\uc138\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voer een GitHub-repository in (bijv. 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') of een directe HTTPS-URL om externe skills te bekijken en te installeren."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podaj repozytorium GitHub (np. 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') lub bezpo\u015bredni adres HTTPS, aby przegl\u0105da\u0107 i instalowa\u0107 zdalne umiej\u0119tno\u015bci."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Informe um reposit\u00f3rio do GitHub (ex.: 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') ou uma URL HTTPS direta para navegar e instalar habilidades remotas."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0423\u043a\u0430\u0436\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0440\u0435\u043f\u043e\u0437\u0438\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0439 GitHub (\u043d\u0430\u043f\u0440\u0438\u043c\u0435\u0440, 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u044f\u043c\u043e\u0439 HTTPS-\u0430\u0434\u0440\u0435\u0441, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0438 \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0443\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u0432\u044b\u043a\u0438."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ange en GitHub-utvecklingskatalog (t.ex. 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') eller en direkt HTTPS-adress f\u00f6r att bl\u00e4ddra bland och installera fj\u00e4rrf\u00e4rdigheter."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uzak becerileri incelemek ve kurmak i\u00e7in bir GitHub deposu (\u00f6r. 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') veya do\u011frudan HTTPS adresi girin."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0456\u0442\u044c \u0440\u0435\u043f\u043e\u0437\u0438\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0456\u0439 GitHub (\u043d\u0430\u043f\u0440\u0438\u043a\u043b\u0430\u0434, 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') \u0430\u0431\u043e \u043f\u0440\u044f\u043c\u0443 HTTPS-\u0430\u0434\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0443, \u0449\u043e\u0431 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0433\u043b\u044f\u0434\u0430\u0442\u0438 \u0442\u0430 \u0432\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u044e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0438 \u0432\u0456\u0434\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0456 \u043d\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0447\u043a\u0438."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nh\u1eadp kho GitHub (v\u00ed d\u1ee5 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') ho\u1eb7c URL HTTPS tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp \u0111\u1ec3 duy\u1ec7t v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng t\u1eeb xa."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8f93\u5165 GitHub \u4ed3\u5e93 (\u4f8b\u5982 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') \u6216\u76f4\u63a5\u7684 HTTPS \u7f51\u5740\uff0c\u4ee5\u6d4f\u89c8\u548c\u5b89\u88c5\u8fdc\u7a0b\u6280\u80fd\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8f38\u5165 GitHub \u5132\u5b58\u5eab (\u4f8b\u5982 'whit3rabbit/agent-skills') \u6216\u76f4\u63a5\u7684 HTTPS \u7db2\u5740\uff0c\u4ee5\u700f\u89bd\u4e26\u5b89\u88dd\u9060\u7aef\u6280\u80fd\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Environment Passthrough (one variable NAME per line)": {
