    "`mcp__server` covers every tool on a server; `mcp__server__tool` covers one. Deny also hides the tool from the assistant.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u064a\u0634\u0645\u0644 `mcp__server` \u0643\u0644 \u0623\u062f\u0648\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0627\u062f\u0645\u060c \u0628\u064a\u0646\u0645\u0627 \u064a\u0634\u0645\u0644 `mcp__server__tool` \u0623\u062f\u0627\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u062d\u062f\u0629. \u0643\u0645\u0627 \u064a\u062e\u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0631\u0641\u0636 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062f\u0627\u0629 \u0639\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u0627\u0639\u062f."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` umfasst alle Tools eines Servers; `mcp__server__tool` genau eines. Verweigern blendet das Tool zudem f\u00fcr den Assistenten aus."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` covers every tool on a server; `mcp__server__tool` covers one. Deny also hides the tool from the assistant."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` abarca todas las herramientas de un servidor; `mcp__server__tool` abarca una. Denegar tambi\u00e9n oculta la herramienta al asistente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` couvre tous les outils d'un serveur ; `mcp__server__tool` en couvre un seul. Refuser masque \u00e9galement l'outil pour l'assistant."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u200f`mcp__server` \u05de\u05db\u05e1\u05d4 \u05d0\u05ea \u05db\u05dc \u05d4\u05db\u05dc\u05d9\u05dd \u05d1\u05e9\u05e8\u05ea; `mcp__server__tool` \u05de\u05db\u05e1\u05d4 \u05db\u05dc\u05d9 \u05d0\u05d7\u05d3. \u05e1\u05d9\u05e8\u05d5\u05d1 \u05d2\u05dd \u05de\u05e1\u05ea\u05d9\u05e8 \u05d0\u05ea \u05d4\u05db\u05dc\u05d9 \u05de\u05d4\u05e2\u05d5\u05d6\u05e8."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0938\u0930\u094d\u0935\u0930 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u092d\u0940 \u091f\u0942\u0932 \u0915\u094b \u0915\u0935\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948; `mcp__server__tool` \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 \u090f\u0915 \u0915\u094b\u0964 \u0905\u0938\u094d\u0935\u0940\u0915\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0930 \u091f\u0942\u0932 \u0905\u0938\u093f\u0938\u094d\u091f\u0947\u0902\u091f \u0938\u0947 \u091b\u093f\u092a \u092d\u0940 \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` mencakup semua alat di sebuah server; `mcp__server__tool` mencakup satu alat. Menolak juga menyembunyikan alat dari asisten."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` copre tutti gli strumenti di un server; `mcp__server__tool` ne copre uno. Il rifiuto nasconde anche lo strumento all'assistente."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` \u306f\u30b5\u30fc\u30d0\u30fc\u4e0a\u306e\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\u30c4\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u3001`mcp__server__tool` \u306f 1 \u3064\u306e\u30c4\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u5bfe\u8c61\u306b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u62d2\u5426\u3059\u308b\u3068\u3001\u305d\u306e\u30c4\u30fc\u30eb\u306f\u30a2\u30b7\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30c8\u304b\u3089\u3082\u898b\u3048\u306a\u304f\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server`\ub294 \uc11c\ubc84\uc758 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \ub3c4\uad6c\ub97c, `mcp__server__tool`\uc740 \ud558\ub098\uc758 \ub3c4\uad6c\ub97c \ud3ec\ud568\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uac70\ubd80\ud558\uba74 \ud574\ub2f9 \ub3c4\uad6c\ub294 \uc5b4\uc2dc\uc2a4\ud134\ud2b8\uc5d0\uac8c\ub3c4 \ubcf4\uc774\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` omvat alle tools op een server; `mcp__server__tool` slechts \u00e9\u00e9n. Weigeren verbergt de tool ook voor de assistent."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` obejmuje wszystkie narz\u0119dzia serwera; `mcp__server__tool` tylko jedno. Odmowa dodatkowo ukrywa narz\u0119dzie przed asystentem."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` abrange todas as ferramentas de um servidor; `mcp__server__tool` abrange uma. Negar tamb\u00e9m oculta a ferramenta do assistente."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` \u043e\u0445\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044b\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u0438\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u044b \u0441\u0435\u0440\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0430; `mcp__server__tool` - \u043e\u0434\u0438\u043d. \u0417\u0430\u043f\u0440\u0435\u0442 \u0442\u0430\u043a\u0436\u0435 \u0441\u043a\u0440\u044b\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0438\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442 \u043e\u0442 \u0430\u0441\u0441\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` omfattar alla verktyg p\u00e5 en server; `mcp__server__tool` omfattar ett. Att neka d\u00f6ljer dessutom verktyget f\u00f6r assistenten."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` bir sunucudaki t\u00fcm ara\u00e7lar\u0131, `mcp__server__tool` ise tek bir arac\u0131 kapsar. Reddetmek ayr\u0131ca arac\u0131 asistandan gizler."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` \u043e\u0445\u043e\u043f\u043b\u044e\u0454 \u0432\u0441\u0456 \u0456\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438 \u0441\u0435\u0440\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0430; `mcp__server__tool` - \u043e\u0434\u0438\u043d. \u0417\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0440\u043e\u043d\u0430 \u0442\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0436 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0445\u043e\u0432\u0443\u0454 \u0456\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442 \u0432\u0456\u0434 \u0430\u0441\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`mcp__server` bao g\u1ed3m m\u1ecdi c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 tr\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7; `mcp__server__tool` ch\u1ec9 m\u1ed9t. T\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i c\u0169ng \u1ea9n c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 kh\u1ecfi tr\u1ee3 l\u00fd."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
