    "Replace this attachment with the selected range and transcribe it again": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0627\u0633\u062a\u0628\u062f\u0627\u0644 \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u0641\u0642 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0646\u0637\u0627\u0642 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062d\u062f\u062f \u0648\u062a\u0641\u0631\u064a\u063a\u0647 \u0646\u0635\u064a\u064b\u0627 \u0645\u0646 \u062c\u062f\u064a\u062f"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diesen Anhang durch den ausgew\u00e4hlten Bereich ersetzen und erneut transkribieren"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Replace this attachment with the selected range and transcribe it again"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reemplazar este adjunto con el rango seleccionado y volver a transcribirlo"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remplacer cette pi\u00e8ce jointe par la plage s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9e et la retranscrire"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u05d4\u05d7\u05dc\u05e3 \u05e7\u05d5\u05d1\u05e5 \u05de\u05e6\u05d5\u05e8\u05e3 \u05d6\u05d4 \u05d1\u05d8\u05d5\u05d5\u05d7 \u05d4\u05e0\u05d1\u05d7\u05e8 \u05d5\u05ea\u05de\u05dc\u05dc \u05d0\u05d5\u05ea\u05d5 \u05de\u05d7\u05d3\u05e9"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0907\u0938 \u0905\u091f\u0948\u091a\u092e\u0947\u0902\u091f \u0915\u094b \u091a\u092f\u0928\u093f\u0924 \u0930\u0947\u0902\u091c \u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0926\u0932\u0947\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u093e\u0902\u0938\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093e\u0907\u092c \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ganti lampiran ini dengan rentang yang dipilih dan transkripsikan lagi"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sostituisci questo allegato con l'intervallo selezionato e trascrivilo di nuovo"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3053\u306e\u6dfb\u4ed8\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u3092\u9078\u629e\u7bc4\u56f2\u3067\u7f6e\u304d\u63db\u3048\u3066\u3001\u3082\u3046\u4e00\u5ea6\u6587\u5b57\u8d77\u3053\u3057\u3057\u307e\u3059"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc774 \ucca8\ubd80 \ud30c\uc77c\uc744 \uc120\ud0dd\ud55c \uad6c\uac04\uc73c\ub85c \ubc14\uafb8\uace0 \ub2e4\uc2dc \ud14d\uc2a4\ud2b8\ub85c \ubcc0\ud658\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze bijlage vervangen door het geselecteerde bereik en opnieuw transcriberen"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zast\u0105p ten za\u0142\u0105cznik zaznaczonym fragmentem i przetranskrybuj go ponownie"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Substituir este anexo pelo trecho selecionado e transcrev\u00ea-lo novamente"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0442\u044c \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0432\u043b\u043e\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0432\u044b\u0431\u0440\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u043c \u0444\u0440\u0430\u0433\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u043e\u043c \u0438 \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0448\u0438\u0444\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0437\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ers\u00e4tt den h\u00e4r bilagan med det markerade intervallet och transkribera den igen"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu eki se\u00e7ili aral\u0131kla de\u011fi\u015ftir ve yeniden metne d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u043c\u0456\u043d\u0438\u0442\u0438 \u0446\u0435 \u0432\u043a\u043b\u0430\u0434\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0432\u0438\u0431\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u043c \u0444\u0440\u0430\u0433\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u043e\u043c \u0456 \u0440\u043e\u0437\u0448\u0438\u0444\u0440\u0443\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0438 \u0437\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0443"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thay t\u1ec7p \u0111\u00ednh k\u00e8m n\u00e0y b\u1eb1ng \u0111o\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ecdn v\u00e0 ch\u00e9p l\u1eddi l\u1ea1i"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7528\u6240\u9009\u8303\u56f4\u66ff\u6362\u6b64\u9644\u4ef6\u5e76\u91cd\u65b0\u8f6c\u5199"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7528\u6240\u9078\u7bc4\u570d\u53d6\u4ee3\u6b64\u9644\u4ef6\u4e26\u91cd\u65b0\u8f49\u5beb"
          }
        }
      }
    },
