    "OpenKind runs as a separate loopback service with its own API key.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u064a\u0639\u0645\u0644 OpenKind \u0643\u062e\u062f\u0645\u0629 \u0627\u0633\u062a\u0631\u062c\u0627\u0639 \u0645\u0646\u0641\u0635\u0644\u0629 \u0628\u0645\u0641\u062a\u0627\u062d API \u062e\u0627\u0635 \u0628\u0647."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind l\u00e4uft als separater Loopback-Dienst mit einem eigenen API-Schl\u00fcssel."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind runs as a separate loopback service with its own API key."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind se ejecuta como un servicio de bucle invertido independiente con su propia clave API."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind fonctionne comme un service de boucle locale distinct avec sa propre cl\u00e9 API."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind \u05e4\u05d5\u05e2\u05dc \u05db\u05e9\u05d9\u05e8\u05d5\u05ea \u05dc\u05d5\u05dc\u05d0\u05d4 \u05d7\u05d5\u05d6\u05e8\u05ea \u05e0\u05e4\u05e8\u05d3 \u05e2\u05dd \u05de\u05e4\u05ea\u05d7 API \u05de\u05e9\u05dc\u05d5."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u0938\u094d\u0935\u092f\u0902 \u0915\u0940 API \u0915\u0941\u0902\u091c\u0940 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u090f\u0915 \u0905\u0932\u0917 \u0932\u0942\u092a\u092c\u0948\u0915 \u0938\u0947\u0935\u093e \u0915\u0947 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u091a\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind berjalan sebagai layanan loopback terpisah dengan kunci API-nya sendiri."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind viene eseguito come servizio di loopback separato con la propria chiave API."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind \u306f\u72ec\u81ea\u306eAPI\u30ad\u30fc\u3092\u6301\u3064\u72ec\u7acb\u3057\u305f\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u30b5\u30fc\u30d3\u30b9\u3068\u3057\u3066\u5b9f\u884c\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind\ub294 \uc790\uccb4 API \ud0a4\ub97c \uac00\uc9c4 \ubcc4\ub3c4\uc758 \ub8e8\ud504\ubc31 \uc11c\ube44\uc2a4\ub85c \uc2e4\ud589\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind draait als een afzonderlijke loopback-service met een eigen API-sleutel."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind dzia\u0142a jako oddzielna us\u0142uga p\u0119tli zwrotnej z w\u0142asnym kluczem API."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind \u00e9 executado como um servi\u00e7o de loopback separado com sua pr\u00f3pria chave de API."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043a\u0430\u043a \u043e\u0442\u0434\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0441\u043b\u0443\u0436\u0431\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u043c\u044b\u043a\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0441\u043e \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438\u043c \u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u043e\u043c API."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind k\u00f6rs som en separat loopback-tj\u00e4nst med en egen API-nyckel."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind, kendi API anahtar\u0131na sahip ayr\u0131 bir geri d\u00f6ng\u00fc hizmeti olarak \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind \u043f\u0440\u0430\u0446\u044e\u0454 \u044f\u043a \u043e\u043a\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0430 \u0441\u043b\u0443\u0436\u0431\u0430 \u0437\u0432\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0442\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0437\u0432'\u044f\u0437\u043a\u0443 \u0437\u0456 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0457\u043c \u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0435\u043c API."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind ch\u1ea1y nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 loopback ri\u00eang bi\u1ec7t v\u1edbi kh\u00f3a API ri\u00eang."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenKind \u4f5c\u4e3a\u5177\u6709\u72ec\u7acb API \u5bc6\u94a5\u7684\u5355\u72ec\u56de\u73af\u670d\u52a1\u8fd0\u884c\u3002"
